  "description": "Perfectly positioned in a peaceful cul-de-sac, this beautifully presented three-bedroom, two-bathroom duplex offers the perfect balance of comfort, convenience and low-maintenance living. Thoughtfully planned for everyday comfort, it provides a practical and welcoming layout that will appeal to a wide range of buyers.<br/><br/>An exceptional opportunity in one of Connolly's most sought-after pockets.<br/><br/>At the heart of the home is a light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and family area, creating a relaxed space for everyday living and effortless entertaining. The functional kitchen overlooks the main living zone, allowing you to stay connected with family and guests while preparing meals. A separate formal lounge at the front of the home provides an additional living area, perfect for relaxing or entertaining.<br/><br/>The spacious master suite is privately positioned and features its own ensuite together with freestanding storage. Two additional bedrooms are well proportioned and are serviced by a centrally located family bathroom.<br/><br/>Step outside to your own private outdoor entertaining area, where you can enjoy weekend barbecues, morning coffee or simply relax in the low-maintenance surrounds. With easy-care gardens both front and back, you'll spend less time on upkeep and more time enjoying the lifestyle this wonderful location has to offer.<br/><br/>Ideally located just moments from local parks, quality schools, shopping centres, public transport and Perth's beautiful northern beaches, the home also enjoys close proximity to the prestigious Joondalup Resort Golf Course, offering an enviable lifestyle in a highly desirable suburb.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>Elevated position in a quiet cul-de-sac<br/>Three bedrooms and two bathrooms<br/>Separate formal lounge<br/>Spacious open-plan kitchen overlooking the family and dining areas<br/>Generous master bedroom with ensuite and freestanding storage<br/>Two additional minor bedrooms<br/>Laminate timber-look flooring throughout the main living and high-traffic areas<br/>Air conditioning – Evaporative <br/><br/>Outdoor Features:<br/>Double remote garage<br/>Spacious outdoor entertaining area<br/>Low-maintenance gardens to the front and rear<br/>Reticulated <br/><br/>**HOW TO ARRANGE A VIEWING**<br/>Please click the “Book an Inspection Time” button and select your preferred inspection time. If no times are available or suit you, please click on “Request an Inspection” and register your details and you will be notified of the next scheduled viewing time. By registering your details, you will be instantly informed of any updates, changes or cancellations for your property appointment. Please ensure that you arrive on time so you have sufficient time to view the property as viewing times cannot be extended.<br/><br/>**ONLINE APPLICATONS ACCEPTED BEFORE VIEWING – head to our website – hky.com.au and select the property for lease and click the APPLY button**<br/><br/>Disclaimer: This advertisement has been prepared with our best endeavours to ensure the information contained in this document is true and correct. We accept no responsibility and disclaim all liability in respect to any errors, omissions, inaccuracies or exclusions in this document. Prospective tenants must make their own enquiries to verify the information contained in this material is true and correct. The particulars are supplied for information only and shall not be taken as a representation of the lessor or its agent as to the accuracy of any details mentioned herein which may be subject to change at any time without notice. No warranty or representation is made as to its accuracy and interested parties should place no reliance on it and should make their own independent enquiries.<br/><br/><br/>",
